{"authored" [{"question" "q-12296" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$S=[\\begin{aligned}-8 & 4 \\\\ -5 & 4\\end{aligned}].$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/state.json" "file_sha256" "def1579efa9e17ed2eeb15ff956d4dffcaf647b3ec61664fe665a85b779303bf" "basis" 1238 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12296" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's start by writing the matrix $S-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nS-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-8-\\lambda  & 4 \\\\ -5 & 4-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(S-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(S-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-8-\\lambda  & 4 \\\\ -5 & 4-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-8-\\lambda )(4-\\lambda )-4\\cdot (-5) & =0 \\\\ -32+8\\lambda -4\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+20 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+4\\lambda -12 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quadratic formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda  & =\\frac{-4\\pm \\sqrt{{4}^{2}+4\\cdot 1\\cdot 12}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4\\pm \\sqrt{64}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4\\pm 8}{2} \\\\  & =-6,2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/state.json" "file_sha256" "def1579efa9e17ed2eeb15ff956d4dffcaf647b3ec61664fe665a85b779303bf" "basis" 1238 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12296" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b65df1969efc25f29516062e2caa1a3c57e4f6191012bead8afceea49150b42e" "basis" 1238 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12296" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/state.json" "file_sha256" "def1579efa9e17ed2eeb15ff956d4dffcaf647b3ec61664fe665a85b779303bf" "basis" 1238 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12296" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =-2$"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/state.json" "file_sha256" "def1579efa9e17ed2eeb15ff956d4dffcaf647b3ec61664fe665a85b779303bf" "basis" 1238 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12296" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =-4$"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/state.json" "file_sha256" "def1579efa9e17ed2eeb15ff956d4dffcaf647b3ec61664fe665a85b779303bf" "basis" 1238 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-12296" "field" "selection" "attribute" "