 "q-76343" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we find the matrix $\\,N-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nN-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-2-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(N-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-2-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-2-\\lambda )(-1-\\lambda )-3\\cdot 3 & =0 \\\\ 2+2\\lambda +\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}-9 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda -7 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c3c572d6561573158c4efb4ed120dac06fa1e72e365cf8c4e53797ddfb306c2"} {"question" "q-76343" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "79b20816ee2127ca92bc867ec7e74c594768d58612675b2b07df5bb09601a1cd"} {"question" "q-76343" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c3c572d6561573158c4efb4ed120dac06fa1e72e365cf8c4e53797ddfb306c2"} {"question" "q-76343" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda -7=0"] ["math" "{\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda -9=0"] ["math" "{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda +9=0"] ["math" "{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda -7=0"] ["math" "{\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda +7=0"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c3c572d6561573158c4efb4ed120dac06fa1e72e365cf8c4e53797ddfb306c2"} {"question" "q-76343" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda -7=0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c3c572d6561573158c4efb4ed120dac06fa1e72e365cf8c4e53797ddfb306c2"} {"question" "q-36771" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix \n$D=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -5 \\\\ 4 & -7\\end{aligned}].$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c3c572d6561573158c4efb4ed120dac06fa1e72e365cf8c4e53797ddfb306c2"} {"question" "q-36771" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we find the matrix $\\,D-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nD-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}5-\\lambda  & -5 \\\\ 4 & -7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(D-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}5-\\lambda  & -5 \\\\ 4 & -7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (5-\\lambda )(-7-\\lambda )-(-5)\\cdot 4 & =0 \\\\ -35-5\\lambda +7\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+20 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+2\\lambda -15 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c3c572d6561573158c4efb4ed120dac06fa1e72e365cf8c4e53797ddfb306c2"} {"question" "q-36771" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "79b20816ee2127ca92bc867ec7e74c594768d58612675b2b07df5bb09601a1cd"} {"question" "q-36771" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "