racteristic equation $det(B-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-4-\\lambda  & -4 \\\\ 16 & 12-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-4-\\lambda )(12-\\lambda )-16\\cdot (-4) & =0 \\\\ -48+4\\lambda -12\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+64 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-8\\lambda +16 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -4)^{2} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the matrix $B$ has only one eigenvalue $\\lambda =4,$ which is a double root of the characteristic equation." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c3c572d6561573158c4efb4ed120dac06fa1e72e365cf8c4e53797ddfb306c2"} {"question" "q-36756" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "79b20816ee2127ca92bc867ec7e74c594768d58612675b2b07df5bb09601a1cd"} {"question" "q-36756" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c3c572d6561573158c4efb4ed120dac06fa1e72e365cf8c4e53797ddfb306c2"} {"question" "q-36756" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "$\\lambda =2$ (double root)"] ["text" "$\\lambda =2$ and $\\lambda =4$"] ["text" "$\\lambda =4$ (double root)"] ["text" "$\\lambda =4$ and $\\lambda =-4$"] ["text" "There are no real eigenvalues"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14068962/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c3c572d6561573158c4efb4ed120dac06fa1e72e365cf8c4e53797ddfb306c2"} {"question" "q-36756" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" 